{"2923650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elasticritters!", "steam_appid": 2923650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/3a34896b6c56e841cbec0c860465545c.webp?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way to victory in <strong>Elasticritters!™</strong>, the dynamic, <strong>fast-paced physics-based platformer</strong> that will challenge your skills and keep you on the edge of your seat. Enter a vibrant world where adorable, squishy critters have learnt to navigate by bouncing due to their rotund nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/5be74e8de6159dc2967a893da9741a5a.poster.avif?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/5be74e8de6159dc2967a893da9741a5a.webm?t=1779084853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/5be74e8de6159dc2967a893da9741a5a.mp4?t=1779084853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through <strong>over 100 unique stages</strong>, each filled with exhilarating jumps and daring stunts. Master the balance between precision and speed to achieve the quickest times. Face challenges of varying difficulty, all featuring distinctive obstacles and stunning, stylish visuals that make every moment pop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as more than <strong>8 adorably chubby critters!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>3 fun and distinct stage types</strong>—each with its own twist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>secrets and unlockables</strong> as you progress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase high scores in <strong>Toy Box Mode</strong> with 2 zany mini-games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn top ranks with the intricate <strong>performance-based ranking system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy gravity by unleashing the powerful, <strong>super-charged Boost Bounce!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove to the cute and catchy <strong>8-bit style soundtrack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/0af5a462d56a4ea468e5a67bbe5c8027.webp?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/950fd442189a584974c5545d27c4aba6.poster.avif?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/950fd442189a584974c5545d27c4aba6.webm?t=1779084853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/950fd442189a584974c5545d27c4aba6.mp4?t=1779084853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate perilous situations and master challenging obstacles using the power of Boost Bounces. Conquer a series of intricate, mind-bending stages that will put your reflexes and adaptability to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/a5a5d021309e73dfc4d43c2f22d3ef44.webp?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/0f7ebfdfe02cf55c9b32528c2ecd198d.poster.avif?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/0f7ebfdfe02cf55c9b32528c2ecd198d.webm?t=1779084853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/0f7ebfdfe02cf55c9b32528c2ecd198d.mp4?t=1779084853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic local multiplayer face-offs across two exciting event types: the fast-paced <strong>Race Event</strong> and the strategic <strong>Flag Event</strong>. Prove your skills and outsmart your opponents in adrenaline-pumping, high-stakes showdowns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hop into the fun and see if you have what it takes to master the art of the bounce!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/3a34896b6c56e841cbec0c860465545c.webp?t=1779084853\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way to victory in <strong>Elasticritters!™</strong>, the dynamic, <strong>fast-paced physics-based platformer</strong> that will challenge your skills and keep you on the edge of your seat. Enter a vibrant world where adorable, squishy critters have learnt to navigate by bouncing due to their rotund nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><